Infinix Hot 40 Pro (X6837) LineageOS
===========

Getting started
---------------

To initialize your local repository using the Infinix Hot 40 Pro (X6837) device trees, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/mmetem55/device_manifest_X6837.git -b lineage-23.2 --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync
```
